// RFC-0224 rule 3, RFC-0244 section 4: a public generic type may compute its flow with `derives Clone(..), Copy(..)` only when the
// computed flow is empty; the fix-it states the flow, naming every parameter of the computed set. The `Clone` entry is checked first.
pub struct Pair<A, B> derives Clone(..), Copy(..) { a: A, b: B }

fun main() {}
